$TTL 300
@ SOA localhost. root.localhost. 1 3600 600 86400 300
  NS  localhost.
;
; Names here are answered normally even when rpz.block lists them.
; A blocklist entry covers subdomains through its own wildcard, so allow both forms:
;   example.com    CNAME rpz-passthru.
;   *.example.com  CNAME rpz-passthru.
